        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "She may have cheated death, but the Ascendant has no intention of leaving survivors. Swarms of Corrupted fan out across the ruins under the Ascendant's orders, hunting for anyone still alive."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "With nowhere to run, Caro squeezes into a narrow, hollow space beneath the rubble and stays still, waiting until the sounds of the Corrupted slowly fade into the distance."
        ]
